IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q02-DEPOSIT-VALIDATION.
*> Validates deposit from 1.00 to 500000.00 (max 2 decimals).
*> Tests: 2500.50 (VALID), 0, -10, 500000.01, 10.123 (INVALID).

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-RAW-AMT          PIC X(20).
01  WS-TRIM-AMT         PIC X(20).
01  WS-INT-PART         PIC X(20).
01  WS-DEC-PART         PIC X(20).
01  WS-DOT-COUNT        PIC 9(2)   VALUE 0.
01  WS-DEC-LEN          PIC 9(2)   VALUE 0.
01  WS-NUM-AMT          PIC 9(12)V99 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-RAW-AMT
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-RAW-AMT) TO WS-TRIM-AMT

    IF WS-TRIM-AMT = SPACES
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    INSPECT WS-TRIM-AMT TALLYING WS-DOT-COUNT FOR ALL "."
    IF WS-DOT-COUNT > 1
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    MOVE SPACES TO WS-INT-PART WS-DEC-PART
    UNSTRING WS-TRIM-AMT DELIMITED BY "."
        INTO WS-INT-PART WS-DEC-PART
    END-UNSTRING

    IF FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-PART) = SPACES
       OR FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-PART) IS NOT NUMERIC
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    IF WS-DOT-COUNT = 1
        MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DEC-PART))
          TO WS-DEC-LEN
        IF WS-DEC-LEN = 0 OR WS-DEC-LEN > 2
           OR FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DEC-PART) IS NOT NUMERIC
            DISPLAY "INVALID"
            STOP RUN
        END-IF
    END-IF

    COMPUTE WS-NUM-AMT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TRIM-AMT)
        ON SIZE ERROR
            DISPLAY "INVALID"
            STOP RUN
    END-COMPUTE

    IF WS-NUM-AMT >= 1.00 AND WS-NUM-AMT <= 500000.00
        DISPLAY "VALID"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
